## Workflow Reference
Implements: ai_toolkit/workflows/feature-delivery/autopilot-phases.md

# Autopilot

**Commit:** false in Direct. Safe and Cloud ask before any commit. Children get `--no-commits`. Never push. Never merge in this run.

**Load:** this file, then one mode file. Do not load `TEAM_GUIDE.md`, `examples/`, `features/auto-detection.md`, or `features/interactive-menu.md`. Do not follow links in the mode file.

| Mode | Extra files |
|------|-------------|
| `direct` (default) | `modes/direct-mode.md` only |
| `safe` or `cloud` | that mode file + `features/commit-strategies.md` |

`features/merge-strategies.md` and `features/conflict-detection.md` only if the user later asks to merge, and only in Safe or Cloud.

## Args

```text
/autopilot-plan <feature|plan-path> [direct|safe|cloud]
```

Autopilot is for `ai_specs` feature plans only: `ai_specs/features/<feature>/plan.md`. Example: `/autopilot-plan ai_specs/features/orders/plan.md direct`. Given a `~/.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`, stop and point to Cursor's Build button. Missing path → stop and ask.

Named mode skips the menu. Otherwise show this and wait. Do not assume Safe or Cloud.

```text
1 Direct — current branch, no commits
2 Safe — temp branch, one commit at the end (asks first)
3 Cloud — per-phase branches, ask before each commit
```

Record `autopilot_mode` and `autopilot_base_branch` in the plan. Git steps are in the one mode file.

## Status

Grep `^Status:`. Do not read the plan to find progress. Skip `done` and `completed`. Next work is the first `pending` or `in-progress`. Resume continues there. Do not restart `done` phases unless asked.

Read only that phase block: number, `Load`, `Inputs` (paths and reply `#ID`s), `Touches`, `Effort`.

## Models (once per plan)

No `autopilot_models` line yet → propose this and wait:

```text
light → fastest model in this session
standard → session default
deep → strongest reasoning model in this session
```

The user may replace the three names. Write the approved line on the plan. `default` → session default for every phase. Do not ask again on this plan.

## Phases

The parent never edits `lib/`, specs, or toolkit files. It only updates plan Status lines, `autopilot_*` lines, and `memory.md`.

Each phase or light batch must be run with the Task tool (`subagent_type` generalPurpose, model from `autopilot_models`). If Task is not loaded, discover it first. Never implement a phase inline.

Up to 3 consecutive `Effort: light` phases share one subagent (Direct and Safe). `standard`, `deep`, and every Cloud phase are one subagent each. Fresh subagent after each return. Pass the approved model for that `Effort`.

**Phase prompt** (one block per phase in a batch):

```text
Autopilot phase child. Do not commit, push, merge, or write memory.
Plan: {path}
Phase: {N} — {title}
Load: {tags}
Inputs: {paths and reply #IDs only}
Touches: {paths}
Memory (read only): ai_specs/features/{feature}/memory.md
App memory (read only if app-memory is in Load): ai_docs/memory.md
Lean loader: /feature-implement-phase --no-commits {N} {path}
Skip test steps. Analyzer on Touches only.
Report, 10 lines or fewer:
Status: done | paused | failed
Files:
Analyzer:
Memory facts:
Blockers:
```

## After each subagent

The parent is the only memory writer. Merge `Memory facts` before the next phase: replace the matching row in feature `memory.md` (≤ 3 KB) and shared facts in `ai_docs/memory.md` (≤ 4 KB). Do not append. Over budget → drop the oldest row in that section.

On success set `Status: done`. Partway → `in-progress`.

**Paused:** child returns `Status: paused` and blockers. Ask, then re-run that phase with the answer. Missing contract → suggest `/backend-contract request <feature> [topic]` and wait. Do not invent it. Do not start later phases.

**Failed:** stop. No commit. No later phases. Safe or Cloud commit only after `done` and only after yes to the files + message. Direct never commits.

## End

`make analyze` once, after the last phase or when the run stops. Do not analyze per phase.

Summary: phases done, any paused or failed phase, mode, nothing pushed or merged. Direct leaves a dirty tree.
